<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Independent Bank cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Independent Bank cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said analyst John Kline downgraded Independent Bank Corp of Rockland, Mass., to hold from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cited stock price.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/16 to 9-1/4 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
